 * V-AXION-512: THE ASCENDED TITAN (v. 29.0.0)\
 * -------------------------------------------\
 * FINAL SPECIFICATIONS:\
 * 1. OS-AWARE AMX: XCR0 check via xgetbv to prevent #UD on unsupported Kernels.\
 * 2. THREAD-LOCAL CONTEXT: ldtilecfg/tilerelease executed per Rayon worker.\
 * 3. GUARANTEED ALIGNMENT: 64-byte layout for AVX-512/AMX zero-fault memory access.\
 * 4. HYBRID JIT: Dynamic x86_64 JIT with non-temporal stores and signal recovery.\
 * 5. NO DELETIONS: All original features (MSR, PMU, NEON, Aligned AVX2) preserved.\
